  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "金融商品與交易制度",
    "sub_ename": "FINANCIAL ASSETS AND TRANSACTION SYSTEM",
    "describe_ch": "隨著財富管理的全球風行，金融商品不斷推陳出新，相對應的交易和管理法律也不斷發展和演進，而衝擊著傳統財經法學領域。對此，如何充分了解金融商品的設計與其衍生之交易與法律制度，並進而創造好的獲利與商業模式，變成是進入財富管理產業最重要的基礎。",
    "describe_eh": "The Wealth management has been the hottest industry in the global economy because of the financial innovation, so does the law governing the transaction and management of wealth. Therefore, how to understand the design of the financial assets and its transaction and legal system in order to create good business models becomes the most important threshold for the wealth management industry.",
