      "describe_ch": "培養財富管理產業的基礎能力，包括如何運用金融商品創造獲利、設計商業模式，並因應法律風險。",
      "describe_en": "Cultivate foundational capabilities for the wealth management industry, including how to leverage financial products to generate profits, design business models, and respond to legal risks."
